depth <= 6). Parse dex hint strings of the form `follow X -> Y`, `ignore field Z` and apply them (skip Z, prefer Y's value). Feeds decode_any for each reached value. Covers the day the answer moves from the asset into a renamed class.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"dalvik-mini-interpreter\", \"concept\": \"answer computed by simple dex bytecode (char arrays, xor/add loops, StringBuilder, switch-flattened control flow) (rows 35, 43, 45)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Tiny pure-python Dalvik evaluator over androguard instructions for ONE method: const*/move*/aget/aput/fill-array-data/new-array/arith-int(lit)/if-*/goto/packed-switch + intrinsics String.<init>([C), StringBuilder.append/toString, String.charAt/length/getBytes, Integer.parseInt, Base64.decode. Step budget 50k, unknown invokes -> abort. Run it on static String-returning methods and on the proof= builder; regex the results. Handles string-encryption helpers and control-flow flattening without a device.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"worker-cue-inline\", \"concept\": \"unseen-theme routing\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"Inline the 'Recognition cues' block above into the mobile worker prompt (skills/huntress-ctf mobile skill) so an unseen container (Flutter/RN/Xamarin/asset dex) is routed in 1-2 turns; add step 2's UTF-16 scan to triage.md pre-extraction.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"permutation-transposition-family\", \"concept\": \"keyless/known-plaintext transposition codecs (row 36)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"When a puzzle `data` is 20 chars containing exactly one each of A,N,S,- but no index list: derive the permutation from the known prefix and the public shape -- stride/affine slot map (i*k+o mod n, D17's order was (3+7i) mod 20), rail-fence (2-5 rails), columnar with width 2-10, even/odd interleave, chunk-reverse. Each family has <= ~200 parameter choices fixed by where A,N,S,- sit; keep only outputs matching ^ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}$ and require a unique match (a decode, never a submit loop).\"},\n  {\"id\": \"reflection-name-resolve\", \"concept\": \"Class.forName / getDeclaredField / getDeclaredMethod with encoded names (row 43)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"androguard: find invokes of Class.forName, getDeclaredField/Method, Field.get, Method.invoke; resolve their String args (const-string, or via dalvik-mini-interpreter for decoded names), map to the real class/field in the dex and return that field's static value. Natural next step after R8 renaming in a resilience arc.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"proguard-mapping-restore\", \"concept\": \"restore original names: mapping.txt / kotlin Metadata / SourceFile (row 45)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"If a question asks 'what was class a / method b originally' or the APK ships assets/mapping.txt|*.map|seeds.txt: parse the ProGuard mapping format (`orig.Class -> a:` + indented `type orig -> b`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/37830cfa-6824-4c93-b6b0-10dc17668190/tool-results/b0na5um4w.txt","persistedOutputSize":36347},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KNR3FECdMCb7FX4v8G7D4U","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
